{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: This purchase includes Chapter One only. Additional chapters will be released later as downloadable content (DLC).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras/4d5c7de785f110fe8e95fa2d061a07b4.poster.avif?t=1772642482\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras/4d5c7de785f110fe8e95fa2d061a07b4.webm?t=1772642482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras/4d5c7de785f110fe8e95fa2d061a07b4.mp4?t=1772642482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by<i> Mouthwashing </i>and<i> Fear Street,\u00a0</i><strong>The Pact</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game in which you unravel your family's dark legacy across generations. Face unsettling trials, uncover truths meant to stay forgotten, and witness the horrors that follow your bloodline through the centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras/72d0f6535834e01fbeb5904a972d5f4b.avif?t=1772642482\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras_big/72d0f6535834e01fbeb5904a972d5f4b.webp?t=1772642482 width=1560 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Will Davidson in the first chapter of <strong>The Pact</strong>, who, after being abducted, will have to explore an uncanny dungeon that's got a sense of evil in the air... Discover the Davidson family's dark secret, solve puzzles, fight to stay alive and make choices that will shatter your 